workspaces.keyboard = Tablo bu araf: Alt+↑/↓ tànn noseet. Ctrl/Cmd+N soppi turam; +S denc ab duppi; +Enter jëfe ko; +U yeesal ko; +R soppi turam; +D far ko; +0 delloo ko.
